</div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§6.1–6.3, print pp. 224–252; PDF pp. 246–274; local typed PDA interface"},{"key":"source_status","html":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§5.2, pp. 108–114; local finite-branch transition/configuration functions"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"local-formalization; source-section-located; proof scope recorded in review"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"6"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,Z_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{PDA}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,Z_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{PDA}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> (pushdown automaton)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_M^*\">\\(\\vdash_M^*\\)</span> (zero-or-more transition relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c7b6c8f19d3f3fc8\" href=\"?note=c7b6c8f19d3f3fc8\" title=\"73-df-pda-transition-semantics\">73-df-pda-transition-semantics</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pda\\text{-}empty\\text{-}stack\\text{-}language}\\vdash\nL_{\\varnothing}(M)\\coloneqq\n\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*:\\exists q\\in Q\\;\n((q_0,w,\\langle Z_0\\rangle)\\vdash_M^*(q,\\varepsilon,\\varepsilon))\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pda\\text{-}empty\\text{-}stack\\text{-}language}\\vdash\nL_{\\varnothing}(M)\\coloneqq\n\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*:\\exists q\\in Q\\;\n((q_0,w,\\langle Z_0\\rangle)\\vdash_M^*(q,\\varepsilon,\\varepsilon))\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Empty-stack acceptance ignores the designated final-state set; this is a distinct language operation from <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_F(M)\">\\(L_F(M)\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-pda-transition-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"c7b6c8f19d3f3fc8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-pda-transition-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-pda-transition-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"c7b6c8f19d3f3fc8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\vdash_M^*$ (zero-or-more transition relation, see [[73-df-pda-transition-semantics]])","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,Z_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{PDA}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash_M^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pda\\text{-}empty\\text{-}stack\\text{-}language}\\vdash\nL_{\\varnothing}(M)\\coloneqq\n\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*:\\exists q\\in Q\\;\n((q_0,w,\\langle Z_0\\rangle)\\vdash_M^*(q,\\varepsilon,\\varepsilon))\\}","display":true},{"tex":"L_F(M)","display":false}],"bytes":1566,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-104","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-pda-empty-stack-semantics|PDA Acceptance by Empty Stack]]"},{"id":"366c2e26a2b77ac2","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$，$L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*$。DPDA/DCFL、前缀性质、空栈语言见 [[73-df-deterministic-pushdown-automaton]]、[[73-df-prefix-free-language]]、[[73-df-pda-empty-stack-semantics]]。"},{"id":"7dd8ceb2520b13ca","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf{PDA}_{\\Sigma}$, $L_F$, and $L